From d3a0a05ddf0c3c8b119133ec714689faf0016cce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Luissalet <luismasc16@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 00:39:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 02/36] Reach the image runtime's reference, control, mask and
 hires fields

buildSdJobPayload sent nine keys; the server's parser reads far more. Each
field added here was checked against SDGenerationParams::from_json_str at
the pinned build rather than against the CLI help, because the two do not
match: PhotoMaker has no request field at all, and upscale_repeats is
parsed into the struct and then only ever read by the CLI.

Also fixes LoRA. This build refuses to parse <lora:NAME:WEIGHT> out of a
prompt on any server API, so the tokens were not being ignored, they were
being encoded as literal words. They now go in the structured lora array.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
